% VERIFIED REFERENCES ONLY.
%
% An entry appears here only once someone has confirmed it resolves to a real paper with a real DOI
% or arXiv ID. paper/check_refs.py fails the build on any key cited in main.tex that is absent here
% or lacks a resolvable identifier.
%
% Existence is not the check that matters. The commoner failure is a real DOI attached to a claim the
% paper does not make, because a search returns something adjacent and it gets accepted as the
% intended reference. So every entry carries a CLAIM: line recording what the paper actually
% establishes, and a USED-FOR: line recording the sentence in main.tex that leans on it. Where the
% sentence is not supported by the CLAIM, the SENTENCE changes or goes -- not the citation.
%
% Verified 2026-08-05.

